                    <p>׳”׳׳×׳¨ ׳׳׳•׳‘׳˜׳— ׳‘׳¨׳׳× SSL 256-bit ׳”׳׳—׳׳™׳¨׳” ׳‘׳™׳•׳×׳¨ ׳‘׳×׳§׳ PCI-DSS. ׳₪׳¨׳˜׳™ ׳›׳¨׳˜׳™׳¡׳™ ׳”׳׳©׳¨׳׳™ ׳©׳ ׳”׳׳§׳•׳— ׳׳™׳ ׳ ׳ ׳©׳׳¨׳™׳ ׳‘׳©׳¨׳×׳™ ׳”׳׳×׳¨ ׳•׳׳•׳¢׳‘׳¨׳™׳ ׳™׳©׳™׳¨׳•׳× ׳׳©׳¨׳×׳™ ׳”׳¡׳׳™׳§׳” ׳”׳׳•׳¨׳©׳™׳. ׳”׳₪׳¨׳˜׳™׳•׳× ׳•׳₪׳¨׳˜׳™ ׳”׳”׳×׳§׳©׳¨׳•׳× ׳©׳ ׳”׳׳§׳•׳—׳•׳× ׳©׳׳•׳¨׳™׳ ׳‘׳“׳™׳¡׳§׳¨׳˜׳™׳•׳× ׳׳׳׳”.</p>
