                    <p>׳›׳ ׳”׳׳—׳™׳¨׳™׳ ׳‘׳׳×׳¨ ׳›׳•׳׳׳™׳ ׳׳¢"׳ ׳›׳—׳•׳§. ׳¢׳ ׳¡׳™׳•׳ ׳”׳”׳–׳׳ ׳” ׳ ׳©׳׳—׳× ׳—׳©׳‘׳•׳ ׳™׳×/׳׳™׳©׳•׳¨ ׳”׳–׳׳ ׳” ׳׳™׳™׳“׳™ ׳‘׳׳™׳™׳ ׳•׳‘-SMS. ׳׳›׳•׳ ׳¢׳•׳– ׳©׳•׳׳¨ ׳׳¢׳¦׳׳• ׳׳× ׳”׳–׳›׳•׳× ׳׳¢׳“׳›׳ ׳׳—׳™׳¨׳™׳ ׳•׳׳‘׳¦׳¢׳™׳ ׳׳¢׳× ׳׳¢׳×.</p>
