                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">׳׳›׳•׳ ׳¢׳•׳– ׳׳•׳ ׳’׳© ׳׳›׳׳ ׳”׳׳§׳•׳—׳•׳× ׳¢"׳₪ ׳×׳§׳ ׳•׳× ׳ ׳’׳™׳©׳•׳× ׳׳©׳™׳¨׳•׳×</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-medium">
                <p>׳׳›׳•׳ ׳¢׳•׳– ׳¨׳•׳׳” ׳‘׳—׳©׳™׳‘׳•׳× ׳¢׳׳™׳•׳ ׳” ׳׳× ׳׳×׳ ׳”׳©׳™׳¨׳•׳× ׳”׳©׳•׳•׳™׳•׳ ׳™, ׳”׳׳›׳‘׳“, ׳•׳”׳ ׳’׳™׳© ׳׳›׳׳ ׳”׳׳–׳¨׳—׳™׳, ׳׳¨׳‘׳•׳× ׳׳ ׳©׳™׳ ׳¢׳ ׳׳•׳’׳‘׳׳•׳™׳•׳×.</p>
