                                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
                                    <span>׳×׳¢׳•׳“׳× ׳”׳’׳”׳× ׳׳—׳©׳‘ ׳•׳’׳‘׳¨׳ ׳׳•׳¡׳׳›׳×</span>
                                    <span class="text-emerald-600 font-black">׳—׳™׳ ׳! נ</span>
