                    <h4 class="font-black text-sm text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <span>נ›ן¸ ׳׳•׳¦׳¨׳™׳ ׳׳•׳׳׳¦׳™׳ ׳׳‘׳™׳× ׳׳›׳•׳ ׳¢׳•׳– (׳׳©׳׳•׳— ׳׳”׳™׳¨ ׳¢׳“ ׳”׳‘׳™׳×)</span>
