                <span>נ’¬ ׳©׳׳ ׳׳× ׳”׳¨׳‘ ׳׳•׳¨׳” ׳”׳•׳¨׳׳” ׳‘׳•׳•׳׳˜׳¡׳׳₪</span>
            </a>
            <button onclick="closeArticleModal()" class="w-full sm:w-auto py-3 px-6 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl transition-all cursor-pointer">
                ׳—׳–׳¨׳” ׳׳¨׳©׳™׳׳× ׳”׳׳׳׳¨׳™׳
